msgid "Default Sales Contract"
msgstr "默认销售合同"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template,intro:sn_wsd_contract.contract_template_sale_default
msgid "Both parties, on the principle of equality, mutual benefit, consideration and agreement, hereby agree on the sale and purchase of the products described below."
msgstr "供需双方本着“平等互利、等价有偿、协商一致”的原则，现就有关产品的销售和采购，达成如下协议。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_other_requirements
msgid "Other Product Requirements"
msgstr "产品其他要求："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_delivery_date
msgid "2. Delivery Date"
msgstr "二、交货日期："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_delivery_date
msgid "Within ____ days after this contract takes effect. For a customer on an agreed payment term the contract takes effect on the signing date; for any other customer it takes effect on the day the supplier receives the down payment agreed in this contract."
msgstr "合同生效后 ____ 天交货。（若需方为协议付款客户，本合同签订之日立即生效；若需方为非协议付款客户，本合同在供方收到合同约定的预付款后当日生效。）"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_technical_requirements
msgid "3. Technical Requirements"
msgstr "三、技术要求："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_technical_requirements
msgid "Inspected against national and industry standards. Where special requirements apply, the technical agreement signed by the two parties is followed."
msgstr "按国家标准、行业标准验收。如有特殊要求，按照供需双方签订的技术协议验收。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_delivery_method
msgid "4. Delivery Method"
msgstr "四、交货方式："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_delivery_method
msgid "Courier / Logistics / Delivered to the door by the supplier / Collected by the buyer."
msgstr "□快递／□物流／□供方送货上门／□需方自提。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_acceptance
msgid "5. Acceptance"
msgstr "五、验收方式："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_acceptance
msgid "The buyer inspects the products within 3 days of delivery and returns the delivery note signed and stamped to the supplier. A delivery note not returned within 3 days counts as acceptance. Damage caused in transport is claimed to the supplier within 3 days and the supplier answers within 3 days; the supplier bears no risk of transport damage claimed later. The VAT invoice is issued in the month of a successful inspection."
msgstr "货到3天内需方应对产品进行验收，验收无误后应签字、盖章后回传供方发货通知单。若收到产品3日内未回传发货通知单即视为默认收货。如果运输造成的破损请需方在3日内向供方提出；供方应在3日内给予回复。逾期供方不承担任何运输造成的风险。验收无误后，增值税发票在当月开具。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_payment_term
msgid "6. Payment Term"
msgstr "六、付款方式："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_payment_term
msgid "Monthly settlement / Full payment before delivery / Down payment of ______ yuan, the balance paid before delivery. The bank and the account of the supplier are the ones written in the party block above."
msgstr "□月结／□全款（款到发货）／□预付款 ______ 元，余款付清后发货。供方开户行及账号见合同双方信息。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_transport_cost
msgid "7. Transport Cost"
msgstr "七、运输费用："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_transport_cost
msgid "Borne by the supplier / Borne by the buyer, ______ yuan (charged as the carrier actually bills)."
msgstr "□供方承担／□需方承担 ______ 元（以运输公司实际收费为准）。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_quality_warranty
msgid "8. Quality Warranty"
msgstr "八、质量保证："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_quality_warranty
msgid "18 months counted from the day the products leave the factory. A product beyond the warranty period is not returned or exchanged. Within the warranty period the supplier bears the transport cost of a quality problem caused by process design or material defects; the buyer bears the transport and repair cost of a return that is not a quality problem, of a specially customised product and of stock returned by the buyer. A labelled product is not returned or exchanged for a non-quality reason."
msgstr "自货物出厂之日起计算，本产品保修18个月。超出质保期限的产品不得退换。在质保期内，因工艺设计、材料缺陷造成的质量问题，由供方承担运输费用；非质量问题、特殊定制产品及因需方库存积压造成的退货，由需方承担运输费用及维修等费用。贴牌产品非质量问题不得退换。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_breach_of_contract
msgid "9. Breach of Contract"
msgstr "九、违约责任："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_breach_of_contract
msgid "A dispute over this contract is settled by the two parties in good time; where no settlement is reached, the case is filed with the people court of the place where the supplier is located."
msgstr "执行本合同发生纠纷，当事人双方应当及时协商解决，协商不成时，向供方所在地人民法院提起诉讼。"

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,name:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_validity
msgid "10. Validity"
msgstr "十、其他约定："

#. module: sn_wsd_contract
#: model:sn.contract.template.clause,content:sn_wsd_contract.clause_sale_validity
msgid "A fax or a scan confirmed by the two parties is legally valid. A hand-written entry must not be altered twice, otherwise it is void."
msgstr "经供需双方确认后的传真、扫描件均合法有效，手工填写处不得二次涂改，否则视为无效。"

